    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "You are Froojarspootz, a long-time under-bed monster. Your bunk-mate Philip has been told to clean his <i>very dirty</i> room, and needs your help!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264430/extras/b38978d1faeb9e4fd364704421413124.poster.avif?t=1726889483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264430/extras/b38978d1faeb9e4fd364704421413124.webm?t=1726889483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264430/extras/b38978d1faeb9e4fd364704421413124.mp4?t=1726889483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Earn cookies and snacks by shuffling debris, from around the floor, into the infinite void beneath the bed! But, don't get caught by the vacuum or other dangers!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264430/extras/demo.GIF?t=1726889483\" /></span><br><br>Grab with the button pad or arrow keys, and move with the D-Pad, left stick, or WASD. Drag the clutter with you to the storage space you emerged from, and clean the room!",
    "about_the_game": "You are Froojarspootz, a long-time under-bed monster. Your bunk-mate Philip has been told to clean his <i>very dirty</i> room, and needs your help!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264430/extras/b38978d1faeb9e4fd364704421413124.poster.avif?t=1726889483\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264430/extras/b38978d1faeb9e4fd364704421413124.webm?t=1726889483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264430/extras/b38978d1faeb9e4fd364704421413124.mp4?t=1726889483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Earn cookies and snacks by shuffling debris, from around the floor, into the infinite void beneath the bed! But, don't get caught by the vacuum or other dangers!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2264430/extras/demo.GIF?t=1726889483\" /></span><br><br>Grab with the button pad or arrow keys, and move with the D-Pad, left stick, or WASD. Drag the clutter with you to the storage space you emerged from, and clean the room!",
    "short_description": "Casual push-and-pull game, cleaning rooms as a hired monster from under the bed.",
